+//! Owned Litecoin execution. Network operations use caller-owned backends;
+//! no automatic relay or approval UI. Explicit trade-start consent is required. Metadata
+//! and secret snapshots use separate private directories. One live controller
+//! owns the metadata directory, serializing this wallet's execution operations.
+use super::*;
